WEBVTT

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:35.970
Were you watching?

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.440
You won't get to see him for two whole days.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.180
Have you finished saying goodbye?

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:44.890
Yes.

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:46.240
That's good.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.980
Then let's go. Time for outdoor school!

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:56.820
Botan?

00:00:58.490 --> 00:00:59.590
Hanako?

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.040
I'm okay. It was shallow.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.790
Jeez!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:07.290
How many times have I told you not 
to sleep with your window open?

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:10.650
Wake up, Ren! We're going to be late!

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.440
You go on ahead.

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:16.800
There's no way I can make it to 
the meeting place on my own!

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.910
Besides...

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:21.420
I want to go with you, Ren...

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:23.350
Don't make me say the whole li—

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.090
They just keep coming!

00:01:28.090 --> 00:01:29.530
Ten more minutes...

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.070
<b>Tennomifune Academy</b>

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.070
<b>Class 1-7</b>

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:12.500
Okay, everyone, we'll be 
arriving at our lodge soon.

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:14.840
I'm so excited!

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.300
Indeed.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:21.240
Teacher, is Timothy not coming with us?

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.840
His maintenance wasn't finished in time.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:30.320
I'm scheduled for a maintenance 
check over summer vacation.

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.460
Like a routine exam at the doctor?

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:33.500
A-Timothy!

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.230
Here's a song to send you off.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:36.900
I see...

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:40.620
But he should be able to meet up 
with us once it's finished.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.400
Until then, I've asked...

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.870
Timo!

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:46.830
Timo!

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:51.680
...the Mini Timothys to be my helpers.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:52.510
Timo!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.500
They were there during the dice game...

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.210
Long time, no see, Mini Timo-chan!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:09.350
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:09.350
<b>August 18</b>

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:09.350
<b>A Stormy Outdoor School</b>

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.270
My head is heavy...

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:17.550
Come to think of it, Hanako-san has 
never been able to pet Timothy-san.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.220
Timothy...

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:19.730
I guess she can't even pet a Mini Timothy.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.310
They're well-made, actually.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:24.810
They're pretty cute.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.410
What? Open your eyes!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.850
These are robots!

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:32.110
You're way too soft on all 
animals, not just rabbits!

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:36.080
Besides, isn't there someone close to you
that you should be nice to instead?

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:40.170
For example, your childhood friend 
who's sitting next to you right now...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.350
Are you even listening, Ren?!

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:45.530
I think we just passed by a pretty big wall.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:46.390
A wall?

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.280
Are you sure you're not imaging things?

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:50.980
We're in the middle of the mountains.

00:04:57.890 --> 00:04:59.360
What?!

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.570
I have to be in their group?

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.300
We're even staying in the same room?

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.900
Ren-chan, you're in our group, too.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.630
I'm pleased we can stay together.

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:08.200
Same.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.660
How were these groups chosen?

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.200
Timo-Timo!

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.870
We're not friends!

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:19.000
After you take your luggage to your rooms,

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.340
we'll begin the happiness training.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.800
<b>Chatter                  Chatter</b>

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:22.940
Already?

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.800
What will the training involve?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.510
We'll start with arts and crafts as a warm-up.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:29.810
How many hours?

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.650
This will be simple carving,

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:34.930
but be careful not to hurt yourselves.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:39.290
I've never done anything like this before.

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.520
We can make whatever we like, right?

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.560
What should I make?

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:45.120
Slowly... Slowly...

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:46.700
<b>Crunch</b>

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:46.700
My finger...

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:48.970
Whatever we like, huh?

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:52.970
Is something wrong?

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.370
No, nyothing!

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:57.370
Should I keep this feeling to myself?

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:02.520
A flower? How cute.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.050
I just picked an easily recognizable shape.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:05.800
What's yours?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.720
Well, this is as far as I've gotten in an hour.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.320
Don't push yourself.

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:13.120
Actually, my bones are already...

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.140
Teacher!

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.250
Heave-ho.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.350
I'm finished!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.220
This is...

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:21.080
It's Timothy.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.700
That's amazing. It looks just like him.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:23.480
Really?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.620
Decapitated...

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:36.920
No way...

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.540
It's just a pile of metal...

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:46.020
Happiness training
Free arts and crafts
Make anything you like

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:46.920
Okay, if you're done, go with your group members

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:48.300
Marguerite

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:51.220
Hole

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.420
to look for positive elements in each work.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:51.470
Make sure you mark them on your sheet.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.470
Timothy

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.410
Sorry ours didn't come out so well.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.770
How does your look, Hagyu-san?

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:02.860
You want to see Hibiki's
sublime artwork? Very well.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:04.660
Check it out.

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.200
It's kind of amazing!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.690
It's wonderful.

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.550
My theme was "love and suffering."

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:14.510
I pushed the idea to its limit
in this masterpiece.

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:16.970
I'm impressed you finished
with ten minutes left.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.040
This doesn't scare you?

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:20.750
What'd you make, Ren-chan?

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:21.820
This.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.550
Futon

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:25.860
It's a futon.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:29.550
These are... creative.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.660
Botan, can you hold your knife?

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.700
If you could use the bandages 
to bind it to my hand...

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.390
I don't think you need to go that far.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.880
I'll feed you.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.560
Botan-chan, say "ah."

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.650
Hanako-san, you're so
considerate, even of me.

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:50.280
"Ah!"

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:52.560
Ah...

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:56.900
Ah...

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.600
Timo!

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.240
Timo!

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.990
Mini Timo-chan, amazing!

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:01.960
Timo-mo!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.380
Eat up.

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.610
I guess we have no choice.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:14.190
Here.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.290
What? D-D-Don't waste your energy!

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:19.720
I've already caused you
so much trouble today...

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:22.560
Hurry up. This is embarrassing.

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:33.530
You two really are like angels!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.070
You're exaggerating.

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:39.290
What?

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.580
I-It's nyothing!

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:44.040
Nyat?!

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:46.570
R-R-Ren?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.190
I-I won't do anything that embarrassing!

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.190
You won't?

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:56.180
O-Of course not. Honestly, who do you think I am?

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.180
Really?

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.720
You're being a pest!

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:03.450
B-But if you really insist...

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.050
I see.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.060
<b>Munch</b>

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:08.560
Delicious.

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:14.840
I thought the students were supposed
to do the cooking here, but I guess not.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.570
Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.960
I'm kind of disappointed.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:23.950
Girls, once you've finished cleaning up, 
it will be time to bathe and go to bed.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:27.070
Make sure you get to bed early and rest up.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.520
Okay.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.170
You'll need it for tomorrow.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:39.720
Hooray, futons!

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.430
Hey, hey! Want to have a pillow fight?

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.480
Pillow fight? What is that?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.630
It's a game where you hit each other
until only one person is left standing.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.150
Don't make it sound so dangerous!

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:51.760
We can't. We'll get in trouble with the teacher.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:52.680
I guess so...

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.080
I'll just roll around, then.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:59.400
Roll, roll, roll...

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.250
I haven't slept in futons much before.

00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.480
Really?

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.870
I can't stop!

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:00.990
I normally sleep in a bed.

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:01.870
Oh, right.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.370
Hand power.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.800
What's wrong, Hanako?

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.240
I can't get my ribbon off.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:11.340
You're hopeless.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:17.900
This reminds me of our sleepover 
at your house, Hibari-chan.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:18.740
Oh...

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.100
You're right.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.560
I'm glad I get to sleep with 
you again tonight, Hibari-chan.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.730
I certainly don't mind.

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:30.920
There.

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.150
Thanks!

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.340
My mom told me

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:39.350
to keep my hairpin close 
while I'm at outdoor school.

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:40.200
Really?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:43.850
I couldn't help overhearing.
You guys had a sleepover?

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:44.370
Yes.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:47.630
Hibiki-san and Ren-san, you've been 
friends since you were little.

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:49.580
Don't you have sleepovers often?

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:52.290
Huh? W-Well...

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.610
We did when we were little, 
but now we don't at all.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.000
She comes over to wake me up, though.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.130
Really?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.940
You're such good friends.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:02.240
O-Of course.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.160
We are?

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:05.120
Don't say things like that!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:07.720
We used to have sleepovers all the time!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:09.440
What? Did I say something wrong?

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:12.790
I'll never forget those days...

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.870
I'm turning off the lights.

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:16.820
Okay!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.400
Goodnight.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:20.250
Goodnight.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:23.240
So scary...

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:25.610
Night.

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:27.370
Y-Yeah... Night.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.320
Goodnight.

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:30.120
Night.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:31.880
Goodnight.

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:43.960
<i>That's right...</i>

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:47.060
<i>It's been a long time since 
I last slept next to Ren.</i>

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.100
<i>Just a little closer...</i>

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:11.500
Hibari-chan?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.210
Did I wake you?

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:15.440
Sorry.

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.630
It's okay. You can't sleep?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.920
It's exciting that we all 
get to sleep together, huh?

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:24.130
It's not that. I'm just not 
used to sleeping in a futon.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.350
I'll hold your hand.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.740
Here.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.070
I still can't sleep...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.080
Sheep, sheep, sheep, Timo?!

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:29.450
Wh-Wh-What's going on?

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:33.150
Wake up, brats! How long are 
you gonna keep sleeping?

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:35.180
I have a message for the happiness class:

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.770
get ready in five minutes 
and meet at the front gate.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:40.140
Anyone who's late will get 
Muay Thai kicked in the ass!

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:40.880
Huh?!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.040
What's going on?

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:43.580
I'm still sleepy...

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.100
We need to hurry up and change!

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.640
Glasses, glasses, glasses, glasses, glasses...

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.140
Ren, don't go back to sleep!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.860
Hurry, hurry!

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:53.520
Line up!

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.020
Each member of all seven teams is here.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:02.830
I'm so glad that you successfully 
completed your first semester,

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:06.120
and with the exception of one sick student,

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.490
you're all here at our outdoor school.

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:09.460
Timo...

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:10.320
Timo...

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:14.160
<b>Miniature Garden Tag</b>

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:14.650
Your Miniature Garden Tag 
happiness training will now begin.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:15.770
Miniature garden?

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:16.870
Tag?

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:19.110
I will be "it," along with...

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.260
Timo!

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:33.790
It's me.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.120
Timothy!

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.270
It's huge!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:37.770
Now, let's begin.

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.230
Wait a minute!

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:41.690
The game has already begun.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:48.080
I'm going to catch you all.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.850
Its arms extended!

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:50.840
Let's run!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:55.120
I don't understand what's going on!

00:14:55.120 --> 00:15:00.080
<b>Anne-Happy</b>

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.530
Hanako!

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:10.490
Botan!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.970
Ren-san!

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.260
Hagyu-san!

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:20.350
We've been totally separated.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.580
What kind of tag is this, anyway?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.150
<i>Students of the happiness class,</i>

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.350
<i>this Miniature Garden Tag game</i>

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:32.110
<i>is a special course designed with 
you young, active girls in mind.</i>

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:33.530
Special course?

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.180
<i>If you haven't been caught yet,</i>

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:37.770
<i>please check the contents of your bag.</i>

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:41.690
Come to think of it, what is inside this bag?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:43.960
Hanako!

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:45.770
I'm coming!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:50.920
Hanako!

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:53.260
Where are you?

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.430
What are you doing?!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.330
Hibari-chan...

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:01.930
Not so loud...

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:03.810
We have bigger problems right now!

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:23.080
Ren-san, it's you.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:26.140
Sorry for the trouble...

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.010
Are you okay?

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:32.300
Thank you. I was looking for the others,

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.440
but the heat and sunlight got to me.

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:39.930
I'd been avoiding danger by crawling 
along the ground like a caterpillar.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:43.310
It's a fitting way for a lowly person 
like me to run from danger.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.460
Shh.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.160
Timo, Timo, Timo, Timo...

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:54.100
Let's go somewhere out of sight.

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:55.070
Okay.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:59.640
Let's go somewhere cool and comfortable

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:02.040
where Ms. Kodaira and Timothy won't find us.

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.700
Are you going to take a nap?

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:08.130
Timo Timo Ti-nom nom nom...

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:14.220
Well, my bag was suddenly 
blown away by the wind.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:17.590
It got caught on the waterwheel, 
but when I tried to get it...

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:17.640
<b>Clang!!</b>

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.550
You got caught, too.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.880
It hurt a little, but I've seen
this kind of thing before.

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.600
It's a Tokugawa era game, right?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.770
I think that's a torture method, not a game.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.300
Really?

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:36.700
He found us?

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.130
Where are they?

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:40.660
He hasn't noticed us.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:44.730
Maybe that thing has a really 
narrow field of view.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:46.460
Now's our chance. This way!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.360
Okay.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:49.880
I'm not lost.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:53.770
A card with a clover mark on it,
a banana, canned bread,

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:57.930
a 500-milliliter plastic bottle,
gloves, a towel, binoculars,

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:02.020
a picnic blanket, and a tag rule book...

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.220
There's this thing, too.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.680
<b>Foof</b>

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:04.560
Don't blow it. They'll find us.

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.310
Let's see...

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:09.610
"The game area is a facility 
surrounded by a wall.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Field</b>

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Lodge</b>

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Waterwheel</b>

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Flowerbeds</b>

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Forest</b>

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Forest</b>

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Cave</b>

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Parking Lot</b>

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.020
<b>Mountains</b>

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.700
Players may run or hide in any way they wish.

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:17.860
If all five of the teammates you're sharing 
a room with are caught, it's game over.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.730
Rank will be determined by totaling

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:24.940
the number of times you and your teammates 
were caught before noon sharp."

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.290
<b>2nd Place</b>

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.620
This four leaf clover 
must be our team symbol.

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:29.980
Yeah.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:33.590
What is this?

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.800
"The top-ranked team will be rewarded 
with a suite and a fine dinner

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.140
of mountain foods on the second 
day of outdoor school.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.310
The lowest-ranked team will 
have to sleep outside together.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.760
They will be responsible for their own food."

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:48.360
There's no way I'm doing that!

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:50.020
Also...

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:54.030
Why am I the only one way up here?!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:56.690
<b>Ren!</b>

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:55.740
Ren!

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.150
I can't... I can't. I can't!

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:02.080
I couldn't even sleep on a tatami floor.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.470
How can I camp outside?

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:05.400
You don't need to worry, Hibari-chan.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:08.300
We just have to hide without 
getting caught until noon, right?

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:09.690
It'll be easy!

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.720
What makes you so confident?

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.330
There's more here.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:14.750
Huh?

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:19.200
The wood carvings we made yesterday 
are hidden all over the place.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:23.070
If everyone on our team finds their 
carving and meets up with the others,

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:25.470
they'll give us bonus points.

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:25.470
<b>10 Points</b>

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:29.680
Find our carvings and meet up? You're right.

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:33.900
They'll find us here eventually, 
and I'm worried about Botan.

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.150
Let's look for the others and our carvings.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:37.210
Yeah!

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.030
<b>Grooooowl</b>

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:46.080
I'm so hungry, I can't take another step.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.620
I guess we didn't even eat breakfast today.

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:50.040
I think I have a banana...

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:50.870
A banana!

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.540
Have this for now.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.770
<b>Flap Flap Flap</b>

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:56.500
No... My banana...

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.880
My banana...

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.470
We have another one.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.470
Let's split it!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.020
I knew this wouldn't work!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.230
Oh, cra—

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:24.100
This isn't working, either!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:24.740
<b>It's not
working!</b>

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.520
I caught a star team member!

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:32.220
But this isn't very efficient.

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:33.620
It's hard to see, too.

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:34.960
All right!

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.450
Go!

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:40.810
Such a beautiful formation...

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.930
Where should we go?

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.460
U-Um...

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:53.670
Timo! Timo-mo!

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:54.640
We can't go this way.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.540
Timo, Timo!

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:03.530
I'm slowing you down again.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:05.400
Please leave me behind.

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:10.000
Timo! Timo-mo!

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.450
Don't make a sound.

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.010
Timo!

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:18.170
Over here.

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:23.510
Ren-san...

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.660
I thought I was going to die.

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:33.810
I escaped the waterfall, though.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.250
I don't want to meet up with 
Hibarigaoka and the others,

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:40.090
but I must, for victory's sake.

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:42.250
First I need to find Ren.

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:53.370
"If need be, grant unto me the 
seven rifts and eight agonies."

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:58.380
Though it pains me to force these cruel trials

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:02.170
on the already unfortunate 
girls of the happiness class,

00:22:02.490 --> 00:22:07.590
they will ultimately help our poor 
students find true happiness.

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:44.110
<b>Fortune</b>

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:44.110
<b>Great
Luck</b>

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:44.110
<b>Anne-Happy</b>

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:44.110
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:44.110
<b>August 19
A Happy
Outdoor School</b>

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:47.110
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:47.110
<b>Terrible 
Luck</b>
